A note on the data

The class schedules in `data/` are derived from the University of Toronto's
public Timetable Builder API. Classroom availability and inventories are
derived from the UTM Classroom Space Database, the St. George Space Management
booking portal, and Scarborough Registrar and IITS classroom services. They are
redistributed as a dated snapshot so the app works without hitting UofT's
servers on every visit. They are not covered by this licence, and they are
not affiliated with or endorsed by the University of Toronto.
